<title>USA: NASDAQ says mid-August short interest up.</title>
<headline>NASDAQ says mid-August short interest up.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON, D.C. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nasdaq Stock Market said on Monday that short interest as of mid-August increased to 1.22 billion shares from 1.15 billion shares in July.</p>
</text>
